OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands facing 'hottest
OL,4,Aever summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was in line with evidence that
OL,7,Fclimate change was driving hotter
OL,8,Fsummers and increasing the likelihood
OL,9,Fof drier conditions, they added.
